### Layer 6 — Squeeze Dynamics (The Volatility Trap)

The Squeeze concept (originally by John Carter) detects when **Bollinger Bands contract inside Keltner Channels** — a period of extreme volatility compression that reliably precedes explosive moves.

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Normal: BB outside KC
    Normal --> Squeeze: BB contracts inside KC
    Squeeze --> Squeeze: Building pressure\n(orange diamonds)
    Squeeze --> FIRE: BB expands outside KC\n(green diamond ⚡)
    FIRE --> Normal: Expansion continues
```

**Why it works:** Volatility is **mean-reverting**. Periods of low volatility ALWAYS end with high volatility. The Squeeze identifies the EXACT moment of transition. Combined with NMC direction, it tells you:
- **Squeeze ON + NMC rising** → Breakout UP imminent
- **Squeeze ON + NMC falling** → Breakdown imminent
- **Squeeze FIRE** → Trade NOW in NMC's direction

